Track 3: Rogue Tide Waltz
- Story & Context: Following the wedding's calamitous collapse, the legend of the "Rogue Tide Waltz" spread like wildfire through the underworld of traveling circuses, recounting how the very ocean itself, enraged by the blasphemous union, had summoned a monstrous, unpredicted wave that washed away half of the Vaudeville Vipers' pier-side tent, leaving behind only the eerie, distorted echo of a 1950s waltz played on a broken calliope, forever warning against unnatural alliances. "The tide will turn, the pact will burn!"
